"BPGftBUdSVOgf2pumtCvNQ","children":[]},{"id":"169","parent":"164","text":"Actividad física → amplia","guid":"fZtLi_JMQLWZ3bh9atvh2g","children":[]},{"id":"170","parent":"164","text":"Psicoterapia → útil según etapa","guid":"v_HarUaIQ86lm0h32T6EoQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"171","parent":"156","text":"Implementación","guid":"B0OelEBERrC-7ikfIOvd2w","children":[{"id":"172","parent":"171","text":"Educación","guid":"fImD97xrTZeKSTNy_vb7og","children":[]},{"id":"173","parent":"171","text":"Protocolos de administración","guid":"p3s6e3x4RLyaCmLKLss5dg","children":[]},{"id":"174","parent":"171","text":"Sistemas de evaluación de efectividad","guid":"-oTlFdzbQaOF5Mw-1n6SMg","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"175","parent":"0","text":"Manejo farmacológico — solo si falla manejo no fx o riesgo agresión","guid":"JiiL6rWdTHWgwjOcpLyVhw","children":[{"id":"176","parent":"175","text":"Recomendaciones por síntoma (JAMA Neurol 2025 - Cummings)","guid":"HlQXW2A_TAqTKfIsC4_Nkg","children":[{"id":"177","parent":"176","text":"Psicosis en Parkinson → Pimavanserina (único antipsicótico aprobado FDA para psicosis NDD, 5-HT2A inverso, reducción relapso 2,8×)","guid":"-PdVs3DtSGewMU1K0MGDww","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"176","text":"Agitación en Alzheimer → Brexpiprazol (primer FDA-aprobado para agitación AD, dosis 2 o 3 mg/día)","guid":"2zRJLkRLTeGrCYePVIDdsQ","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"176","text":"Agitación / depresión → Citalopram (~30 mg riesgo QT, hiponatremia)","guid":"ZFHno8CZQUCVke50JxFaUQ","children":[]},{"id":"180","parent":"176","text":"Apatía → Metilfenidato","guid":"4Z_5-U1dR3unReCDhD1fUw","children":[]},{"id":"181","parent":"176","text":"Depresión → Venlafaxina, Vortioxetina (fuera etiqueta), Paroxetina último por anticolinérgico","guid":"yTT_bnJgSzqmoSQ3F_ZKyw","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"176","text":"Desinhibición → Citalopram (ensayos)","guid":"uByq2OOJQnq5YhztrN60_Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"183","parent":"175","text":"Riesgos por antipsicótico","guid":"j_4da_htTfqh3pDEV0LHNA","children":[{"id":"184","parent":"183","text":"Olanzapina → cardiometabólico alto, anticolinérgico alto, sedación alta","guid":"_G_I_-BuQK6osjVNf7TEHg","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"183","text":"Risperidona → MAYOR ACV, MAYOR extrapiramidales","guid":"vFaf-gGCSG633Gf3KIbwMQ","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"183","text":"Quetiapina → más sedante, menos antipsicótica, menos parkinsonismo","guid":"QWkqSlyGSxmD_FQAElrA0g","children":[]}]},{"id":"187","parent":"175","text":"Principios de prescripción (Lancet Alzheimer 2025 - Fox)","guid":"-SypqWE2Tdi4gVDoHfAxEA","children":[{"id":"188","parent":"187","text":"Considerar propiedades neuroquímicas según síntoma","guid":"g6kEtOwXRdu1-sG8Z2sNxA","children":[]},{"id":"189","parent":"187","text":"Evitar fármacos anticolinérgicos","guid":"vgVjcvYHTxK9awYvbQbffQ","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"187","text":"Minimizar número de psicotrópicos","guid":"eXFVkd1QTE-XNLI4r-PpSQ","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"187","text":"Usar fármaco con doble eficacia cuando posible","guid":"A8JGYeZdRzOKI2fumhvKTA","children":[{"id":"192","parent":"191","text":"Trazodona diurna + nocturna mayor dosis","guid":"gRv-My43RzyZe2fKbDW0Rw","children":[]},{"id":"193","parent":"191","text":"Mirtazapina → bajo apetito + insomnio + ansiedad/depresión","guid":"fVx28rNzQ4myV071phnsBQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"194","parent":"187","text":"\"Start low, go slow, prescribe and review\" → 1/8-1/4 dosis adulto, ajuste 2-4 sem","guid":"aYOMsUnlSoGygu7NJK9y_g","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"187","text":"Seguimiento de ciclos cortos","guid":"pI70w2ZmRIWobmrpgqd3-w","children":[]},{"id":"196","parent":"187","text":"Nunca prolongar indefinidamente","guid":"wp_tUfuiSFKUhYdAN0JcDg","children":[]},{"id":"197","parent":"187","text":"Intento reducción gradual tras 3 meses de estabilidad","guid":"aVzOpDUxQ7mtN9tBVQeMUw","children":[]},{"id":"198","parent":"187","text":"Si no eficaz en 6 sem → suspender (criterios Crohn)","guid":"oSoY2SQ3TkWdwxf50FiZOQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"199","parent":"175","text":"Inhibidores acetilcolinesterasa y memantina (Lancet Alzheimer 2025)","guid":"61U_sd6qRJq8dQB_XBR7JA","children":[{"id":"200","parent":"199","text":"IAChE → modesto beneficio cognitivo + ↓ progresión a severo + ↓ uso antipsicóticos","guid":"uj3PM16jQQivPe_cr7oUgg","children":[]},{"id":"201","parent":"199","text":"Donepezilo 10 mg → más efectivo leve-moderado","guid":"P2IDaYoZSlW1IYUW1ZT5rA","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"199","text":"Memantina 20 mg → efectiva moderado-severo (NO leve)","guid":"zs8J79RxTE-1Wj9bkJyLYw","children":[]},{"id":"203","parent":"199","text":"Memantina ↓ emergencia de SPCD","guid":"iBAMzVaAT9uCPufs2A6lRA","children":[]},{"id":"204","parent":"199","text":"Combinación memantina + donepezilo → mayor efecto en moderado-severo","guid":"BlwbtPzMRSiLH6nejAX5bA","children":[]},{"id":"205","parent":"199","text":"Efectos colaterales IAChE → náuseas y vómitos 1 en 4-7 pacientes; urgencia urinaria simil vejiga hiperactiva","guid":"K9zep_FKQOilMk6xWLEG-g","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"199","text":"Discontinuación → cautelosa e individualizada","guid":"kHdsOHR3T6WXiIkZyZgyhQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"207","parent":"175","text":"Anti-amiloide (Lancet Alzheimer 2025)","guid":"PoJzWz5OTeWo7ZyMUPE6Kg","children":[{"id":"208","parent":"207","text":"Lecanemab y donanemab → primeros disease-modifying aprobados; ralentizan declive ~30%","guid":"XtKghrqsS6CDcsSSdKXOLw","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"207","text":"ARIA-E (edema) y ARIA-H (hemorragia) → 9% lecanemab, 36,8% donanemab tratados","guid":"y7JSXGEzTxuEVrjIVsXY1A","children":[]},{"id":"210","parent":"207","text":"Monitoreo RM regular obligatorio","guid":"aMs74bDMRhGpjy9NYeYhxQ","children":[]},{"id":"211","parent":"207","text":"ApoE ε4 homocigotos → riesgo ARIA significativamente mayor","guid":"vw4swIWDQzOiJnANIBOO6g","children":[]},{"id":"212","parent":"207","text":"Aducanumab → reducción de patología β-amiloide con mejoría de SPCD observada","guid":"ZmV5z7YXSjOWSA-rfzlBRA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"213","parent":"0","text":"Prescripción inadecuada y sujeción química","guid":"uUnxdoEMT4uoRO0CJ0bVww","children":[{"id":"214","parent":"213","text":"Prescripción inadecuada","guid":"vNHM5VsSRh6ne74isdZ2Uw","children":[{"id":"215","parent":"214","text":"Riesgo > beneficio","guid":"qqFAQVgOSOmSwoZXojiVvw","children":[]},{"id":"216","parent":"214","text":"Existen alternativas más seguras","guid":"wFjjpOiMRu-wYmDhYX5ZLg","children":[]},{"id":"217","parent":"214","text":"Frecuencia/duración mayor a indicada","guid":"aLfW6--uSQu8-7DcSLSl2Q","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"214","text":"Alto riesgo de interacciones","guid":"iBthDUoYStSRpzkHltp8HQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"219","parent":"213","text":"Sujeción química","guid":"Wa3EmjzGQA-MklD2rTiMwg","children":[{"id":"220","parent":"219","text":"Psicofármaco por conveniencia organizativa","guid":"z-4hmAwxTjq17mfTAlMe9Q","children":[]},{"id":"221","parent":"219","text":"Sin diagnóstico neuropsiquiátrico claro","guid":"zC0ZsPXwQ2y_vUdF2CbrmQ","children":[]},{"id":"222","parent":"219","text":"Limitar expresiones que molestan al entorno","guid":"i7PMHruARLqs1i-Qx2F1OA","children":[]}]},{"id":"223","parent":"213","text":"Datos España","guid":"nvoGnRE3TyCRLIE-hTikJA","children":[{"id":"224","parent":"223","text":"90% personas con demencia reciben psicofármacos","guid":"BJUPGQYrQAmM6WXPMFfMTg","children":[]},{"id":"225","parent":"223","text":"Predominio neurolépticos + benzodiazepinas","guid":"C8f9e4DFTN2-XZO238u1ww","children":[]}]},{"id":"226","parent":"213","text":"Consecuencias","guid":"SuT74IzwSbK1kYMh17CraQ","children":[{"id":"227","parent":"226","text":"Menor calidad de vida","guid":"Gu5LP-tmSXSqzg-2ey_TnA","children":[]},{"id":"228","parent":"226","text":"Efecto débil sobre agitación/psicosis","guid":"8PYmNXWiSfyd8q4avwfINw","children":[]},{"id":"229","parent":"226","text":"Aumento mortalidad y riesgo cardiovascular","guid":"J5NGTtnVTtWZTUlSHCy-7Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"230","parent":"213","text":"Criterios CRONOS / Crohn (España 2018)","guid":"JIDBm0zLTOmMESuAEV0Khw","children":[{"id":"231","parent":"230","text":"Metodología auditable","guid":"7DxChVqvSZKYtsVXW1h0Cw","children":[]},{"id":"232","parent":"230","text":"Reevaluación continua","guid":"OASTuHufSuiwX9ESb6ANFg","children":[]},{"id":"233","parent":"230","text":"¿Diagnóstico sindromático asociado al fármaco?","guid":"HeYU_102RGe9LMIIciRysw","children":[]},{"id":"234","parent":"230","text":"¿Contexto de cuidados óptimos?","guid":"9fTTwS4TTduyQshAw2C_-A","children":[]},{"id":"235","parent":"230","text":"AD vs neuroléptico según perfil","guid":"2V4ypsoaSEq2nDD-M8rtIA","children":[]},{"id":"236","parent":"230","text":"Cuándo desprescribir si estabilidad","guid":"S62kPi-fRTKq-GuG2TeLXA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"237","parent":"0","text":"Caso clínico ilustrativo","guid":"wki-aeNFRcOi2FXyoKCt5Q","children":[{"id":"238","parent":"237","text":"Mujer 86a, Alzheimer avanzado, deterioro funcional moderado, ELEAM","guid":"KGfyvMu4ShiKMqEVw1-nTg","children":[]},{"id":"239","parent":"237","text":"Conducta → irritable y agresiva al ser asistida","guid":"2T0ybzhJQ-aCYdmwThIFiA","children":[]},{"id":"240","parent":"237","text":"Tratamiento previo → analgésicos para artritis no pedidos","guid":"hBwnIiE4QfKWNnpGZdF8KQ","children":[]},{"id":"241","parent":"237","text":"Hipótesis (DICE) → dolor + interacción del personal","guid":"Lyw4IVHRTLKiwzHEhSlpRg","children":[]},{"id":"242","parent":"237","text":"Manejo","guid":"tIP-5fRWSWyHvbiWPVqwHQ","children":[{"id":"243","parent":"242","text":"Descartar otras afecciones médicas","guid":"hoPNuAbaRPq-b12PZ6Iz9w","children":[]},{"id":"244","parent":"242","text":"Analgésicos REGULARES (no PRN)","guid":"2cZNXcsASduC7FRi6t7OPg","children":[]},{"id":"245","parent":"242","text":"Capacitar al personal","guid":"DoEySAmpTYCmwFL260iuCw","children":[{"id":"246","parent":"245","text":"Comunicación no amenazante","guid":"BhrQk99WTnaaoKEQv_yexQ","children":[]},{"id":"247","parent":"245","text":"Tono suave","guid":"UZQXRERHQoqRBDpbq2Pv5g","children":[]},{"id":"248","parent":"245","text":"No verbal tranquilizador","guid":"hwi3-LNjQKiQgAP1o-gxdw","children":[]},{"id":"249","parent":"245","text":"Más tiempo en interacción","guid":"tIAQKq2AQjqEUYKDRUnVyA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"250","parent":"237","text":"Resultado → remisión en 2 semanas sin antipsicótico","guid":"LpwE6eDJS4WpFsjWurjbCw","children":[]},{"id":"251","parent":"237","text":"Lección → no todo PSCD requiere psicofármaco","guid":"-Zg6Y9WbRcuiKaDNRMZ8MQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"252","parent":"0","text":"Preguntas Autoestudio (oficiales Dra. Paulina Vergara)","guid":"0mQXBGxDSDOUCiMvS6tlOA","children":[{"id":"253","parent":"252","text":"1. ¿Qué son los síntomas psicoconductuales en la demencia y cuáles son los más frecuentes que se observan en la atención primaria de salud?","guid":"ViZVBl4ST0SdoXfbYkUJMQ","children":[]},{"id":"254","parent":"252","text":"2. ¿Qué factores biológicos, psicológicos, ambientales y sociales pueden desencadenar o agravar los síntomas psicoconductuales en personas con demencia?","guid":"aX1JDUQ5QUOXmmgC6yhBWA","children":[]},{"id":"255","parent":"252","text":"3. ¿Cómo puede el equipo de salud diferenciar entre síntomas propios de la progresión de la demencia y delirium? ¿Cómo puedo educar al cuidador en este tema?","guid":"-ktAqPSKQfWH98oefSoW7A","children":[]},{"id":"256","parent":"252","text":"4. ¿Qué estrategias no farmacológicas pueden implementarse en la atención primaria y en el hogar para manejar síntomas como agitación, agresividad, ansiedad o deambulación?","guid":"OCIKweQWQsOEFNXH5xBmOQ","children":[]},{"id":"257","parent":"252","text":"5. ¿Cuál es el rol de los distintos profesionales del equipo multidisciplinario (médico, enfermería, psicología, trabajo social, terapia ocupacional, kinesiólogo) en la evaluación y manejo de los síntomas psicoconductuales?","guid":"bGEOCMzDTJSJLjoOYn5cOg","children":[]},{"id":"258","parent":"252","text":"6. ¿Cómo impactan los síntomas psicoconductuales en la calidad de vida de la persona con demencia, su familia y cuidadores?","guid":"tw2bPjPmTZKx1j7rR451Jw","children":[]},{"id":"259","parent":"252","text":"7. ¿Qué cambios conductuales suelen aparecer en las etapas avanzadas o al final de la demencia?","guid":"_esyQKYIQYazKuYNZg_4Lw","children":[]},{"id":"260","parent":"252","text":"8. ¿Qué intervenciones del equipo de salud pueden favorecer el confort, la dignidad y el acompañamiento adecuado de la persona con demencia en la etapa final de la vida?","guid":"Ub9jLlbPQnmnwS2bA27Dvw","children":[]}]},{"id":"261","parent":"0","text":"Evidencia complementaria (papers oficiales)","guid":"9ghT8cq6RlaAvEPypOFZSg","children":[{"id":"262","parent":"261","text":"Lancet Alzheimer 2025 (Fox, Belder, Ballard, Kales et al; Series 2) → tratamiento integral; IAChE + memantina como base + anti-amiloide en early AD; principios prescripción psicotrópica","guid":"kRPCyl66TniahWtwEwYLVw","children":[{"id":"263","parent":"262","text":"NO es el Livingston 2024 (14 factores de riesgo modificables); este Lancet 2025 es sobre TRATAMIENTO sintomático y disease-modifying","guid":"QCO6XQ3GQLK3he00ney8tA","children":[]}]},{"id":"264","parent":"261","text":"JAMA Neurol 2025 (Cummings - manejo SPCD revisión) → mapa farmacológico por síntoma","guid":"z94lAzhBQfGb5d_9y8orWw","children":[{"id":"265","parent":"264","text":"Pimavanserina aprobada para psicosis Parkinson (reducción 2,8× relapso)","guid":"7yR0apGFQ0W4nAWzW2zCEw","children":[]},{"id":"266","parent":"264","text":"Brexpiprazol aprobado para agitación AD (2-3 mg/día)","guid":"LMV29yd6Qi2qu6cF7dxDaA","children":[]},{"id":"267","parent":"264","text":"Citalopram → eficacia anti-agitación (CitAD trial) pero 30 mg con QT, hiponatremia","guid":"QHQrW0lgQ7-e6YTn1XrQxg","children":[]},{"id":"268","parent":"264","text":"Black box warning: antipsicóticos ↑ mortalidad en mayores con demencia","guid":"DHQjFGDUROqBTtIIQW7Tpg","children":[]}]},{"id":"269","parent":"261","text":"Cochrane 2021 (Davies) → SNG/PEG en demencia avanzada NO mejora sobrevida ni nutrición; aumenta UPP","guid":"9y9LV_SJRYKLSTC0Cabfng","children":[]},{"id":"270","parent":"261","text":"Mitchell JAMA 2010 → índice predictor 6-meses; UPP, disfagia, ↓peso, dependencia, incontinencia, ICC","guid":"VpBIYOAASNyEujjTF4iTQA","children":[]},{"id":"271","parent":"261","text":"Reisberg 1988 → escala FAST original","guid":"V5jnUnuPTgmnyoIUgFiTRg","children":[]},{"id":"272","parent":"261","text":"Kales 2014 (J Am Geriatr Soc) → DICE original","guid":"51_LPPsSQRWQYeRxUtN9Ig","children":[]},{"id":"273","parent":"261","text":"Cummings 1994 (Neurology) → NPI validación","guid":"vPNb1LzORr2lIp9_OuqlLQ","children":[]},{"id":"274","parent":"261","text":"Vergara (capítulo cuidados paliativos) → criterios terminalidad, comfort feeding only, GES-MINSAL Chile, ATB no mejoran sobrevida vs paliación","guid":"qQW_YFXfSCOSwBwaYfwpqg","children":[]}]},{"id":"275","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"criQG3gmRjGotOkxSVtiNg","children":[{"id":"276","parent":"275","text":"Perla 1: \"No hay nada más que hacer\" → NUNCA decirlo. Cambia el foco a CONFORT > expectativa de vida","guid":"N4yx4o5ATQaYzyj5N5Zc3Q","children":[]},{"id":"277","parent":"275","text":"Perla 2: PSCD = comunicación, no patología a sedar → aplicar DICE antes de prescribir","guid":"p_f1RdwKS5SShJTspsuBPg","children":[]},{"id":"278","parent":"275","text":"Perla 3: SNG/PEG en demencia avanzada NO mejora sobrevida ni calidad → comfort feeding only (GES-MINSAL)","guid":"vosOtygPT1imw79ggSOcag","children":[]},{"id":"279","parent":"275","text":"Perla 4: ATB en infecciones en demencia terminal NO mejora supervivencia vs paliativo → cambia decisión en neumonías recurrentes GDS 7C-F","guid":"rkzSzAjPTXSsZoX1CeSlSA","children":[]},{"id":"280","parent":"275","text":"Perla 5: GDS 6-7 = avanzada → sub-etapificar FAST anticipa pérdidas (palabras → ambular → sentarse → sonreír → cabeza)","guid":"P9C1oQAuSf2sguwxCDNTsQ","children":[]},{"id":"281","parent":"275","text":"Perla 6: Diferenciar PSCD vs delirium → delirium NO remite espontáneo y exige causa médica (ITU, fecaloma, descompensación)","guid":"5fNXIakiTOqn5Jj2pQgEPg","children":[]},{"id":"282","parent":"275","text":"Perla 7: Start low, go slow, prescribe and review → 1/8-1/4 dosis adulto, ajuste 2-4 sem; reducción tras 3 meses estabilidad; suspender si no útil en 6 sem","guid":"Oa7msciXQzWznq12s1K6wA","children":[]},{"id":"283","parent":"275","text":"Perla 8: Risperidona = más antipsicótica pero más ACV + parkinsonismo; quetiapina = menos antipsicótica pero menos parkinsonismo","guid":"qB1ABz9_QZCPGcmIurC1jA","children":[]},{"id":"284","parent":"275","text":"Perla 9: Sujeción química = psicofármaco por conveniencia, sin diagnóstico, para calmar al cuidador → auditar contra criterios CRONOS","guid":"df_DDB_BQcaAMPqXLdnPUQ","children":[]},{"id":"285","parent":"275","text":"Perla 10: Intervención de dolor + comunicación + ambiente puede revertir agitación en 2 sem sin antipsicótico → preguntar SIEMPRE por dolor, constipación, ITU antes de prescribir","guid":"rMu5CQsJT6a-8gVO5tm85Q","children":[]},{"id":"286","parent":"275","text":"Perla 11: Brexpiprazol = primer FDA-aprobado para agitación AD (Cummings 2025) → opción cuando manejo no fx falla; black box warning sigue vigente","guid":"J-VkMKBCSdu_29FiuzIWZw","children":[]},{"id":"287","parent":"275","text":"Perla 12: Pimavanserina = único aprobado FDA para psicosis Parkinson (Cummings 2025) → 5-HT2A inverso, no D2; valorar en PSCD psicótico de DCL/EP","guid":"ZiK_CGN6Rk-U6V55cXvmbg","children":[]},{"id":"288","parent":"275","text":"Perla 13: Memantina ↓ emergencia de SPCD (Lancet 2025) → considerar uso temprano en moderado-severo, no esperar al PSCD constituido","guid":"tVrUM6cmSASrnf-lMk50Ig","children":[]},{"id":"289","parent":"275","text":"Perla 14: Anti-amiloide (lecanemab/donanemab) ralentiza declive ~30% pero ARIA-E/H >35% en donanemab; ApoE ε4 homocigoto = riesgo mayor → screening genético + RM seriadas obligatorias","guid":"enqRRSVnSbqyo2y3JeI7uw","children":[]}]},{"id":"290","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados (Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"SuXvkTA0TEWFioB5wR334Q","children":[{"id":"291","parent":"290","text":"Evaluacion M2","guid":"c74S6bAFQFO-_a4_DYKJcA","children":[{"id":"292","parent":"291","text":"P3 (marco AT(N) Alzheimer): A=PET amiloide o Abeta42/40 LCR; T=p-tau LCR/plasma o PET tau; N=atrofia RM, FDG-PET, NfL plasmatico -> marco NIA-AA aplicable al diagnostico biomarcadores","guid":"wO33fRkbQyW_Ad5tx-S4Dg","children":[]},{"id":"293","parent":"291","text":"P4 (Alzheimer avanzado + irritabilidad al asistir): primer paso EVALUAR DOLOR + gatillos + modificar interaccion del equipo -> NO antipsicotico; antipsicotico ultima linea dosis baja; contencion fisica empeora","guid":"cvmJaMGJTyGn2O40Z2lg6w","children":[]},{"id":"294","parent":"291","text":"P20 (Alzheimer avanzado + disfagia severa - MINSAL): mantener alimentacion oral con estrategias compensatorias + alimentacion de confort -> NO SNG/PEG rutinaria (no prolonga sobrevida ni calidad, sube agitacion/aspiracion)","guid":"7IKpWC8iTjCIy_VadPz9GA","children":[]}]},{"id":"295","parent":"290","text":"Evaluacion Final (transversales)","guid":"cg5L1oneRCi9-FKAkmGMHg","children":[{"id":"296","parent":"295","text":"P8 (demencia avanzada FAST 7 - ayudas tecnicas): colchon antiescaras para paciente postrado -> conectar con prevencion UPP en demencia avanzada (cama + cambios posturales)","guid":"ABhUCqQhTbGHyS1qWYI1qg","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"297","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (bibliografía oficial Dra. Paulina Vergara)","guid":"59g4OIJuSJe7nli2JBQJPA","children":[{"id":"298","parent":"297","text":"1. Reisberg B. Functional Assessment Staging (FAST). Psychopharmacol Bull. 1988;24(4):653-659","guid":"vAHrHYD4Rd6o6xc3EvStmQ","children":[]},{"id":"299","parent":"297","text":"2. Mitchell SL, et al. Prediction of 6-month survival in advanced dementia. JAMA. 2010;304(17):1929-1935","guid":"42J2he83QauLXNkeaLKPfA","children":[]},{"id":"300","parent":"297","text":"3. Kales HC, Gitlin LN, Lyketsos CG. Management of neuropsychiatric symptoms of dementia (DICE). J Am Geriatr Soc. 2014;62(4):762-769","guid":"nGfjZIWLS1-wUxeWMm4Pdg","children":[]},{"id":"301","parent":"297","text":"4. Cummings JL, et al. The Neuropsychiatric Inventory (NPI). Neurology. 1994;44(12):2308-2314","guid":"LVJlQboQStSI230-z5UmzQ","children":[]},{"id":"302","parent":"297","text":"5. Davies N, et al. Enteral nutrition for advanced dementia. Cochrane Database Syst Rev. 2021","guid":"3k-9gWD-QQKbMJMDABnx9w","children":[]},{"id":"303","parent":"297","text":"6. Cummings J, et al. Pharmacotherapy of Neuropsychiatric Symptoms in Neurodegenerative Disorders. JAMA Neurol. 2025 (revisión SPCD)","guid":"bM0ik0m2SfiQNIBHIDXWdA","children":[]},{"id":"304","parent":"297","text":"7. Fox NC, Belder C, Ballard C, Kales HC, et al. Treatment for Alzheimer's disease (Series 2). Lancet. 2025;406(septiembre 27):1408-1423. doi:10.1016/S0140-6736(25)01329-7","guid":"EoWKufmfTXC1IO3GjsRP2g","children":[]},{"id":"305","parent":"297","text":"8. Vergara P. Abordaje en PSCD y conductas clínicas en Demencia Avanzada (capítulo/clase original, SGGCh 2026)","guid":"ces9HHmVQW-wWdugH7KLBQ","children":[]},{"id":"306","parent":"297","text":"9. Pérez Zepeda MU. Cuidados paliativos en demencia y otras enfermedades neurodegenerativas. Tópicos de actualización","guid":"zgx-qnQTTruaafuF7HIuzQ","children":[]},{"id":"307","parent":"297","text":"10. Criterios CRONOS/Crohn (consenso español 2018)","guid":"w8QKIbKbR2qs3W97LhjttQ","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":307,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Cardiología","folder":"Entidades clínicas/MKSAP - 18/Cardiología","filename":"10. Enfermedades de la aorta","id":"map_168","resolved_references":[]}